{"sections":[{"slug":"同伦纤维塔","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"同伦纤维塔"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">同伦纤维塔</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“同伦纤维塔”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">一个同伦纤维塔是形如</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccc}\r\n\t\\vdots &amp;&amp; \\\\\r\n\tX_2 &amp; \\overset{f_2}{\\to} &amp; A_2 \\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\\\\r\n\tX_1 &amp; \\overset{f_1}{\\to} &amp; A_1 \\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\\\\r\n\tX_0 &amp; \\overset{f_0}{\\to} &amp; A_0\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">的图</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $X_{n+1} \\to X_n \\overset{f_n}{\\to}A_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为同伦纤维列</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">纤维列的同伦群长正合列</span>\n$$\r\n\\pi_\\bullet(X_{\\bullet+1})\\to\\pi_\\bullet(X_\\bullet)\\to\\pi_\\bullet(A_\\bullet)\\to\\pi_{\\bullet -1}(X_{\\bullet+1})\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">构成</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">双分次</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群的</span>) "},{"Local":{"url":"/正合偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正合偶</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">进而产生一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱序列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱序列</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其第一页是</span> $\\pi_\\bullet (A_\\bullet)$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/滤过谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤过谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov <span lang=\"zh\">塔</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Adams谱序列","text":"Adams <span lang=\"zh\">谱序列</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}